WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.450
The fair lineup

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.570
Doing the lineup by hand is an hour of math every week.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:12.500
The parents’ answers are already in. Zack is sick: he’s taken out.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.430
Short a player? One tap, and your affiliated player is in the game.

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:25.850
Liked Saturday’s lineup? Start from it: same positions, same order, adjusted to who’s here.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.410
Otherwise, one click on Generate…

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.430
… and everyone gets their playing time, in the infield and in the outfield.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:38.490
Six innings, six different players on the bench.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:42.410
And the Baseball Québec rules are checked for you.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:47.580
You’d rather have Mathis at first base? Tap the cell…

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.670
… pick Mathis, and the two players swap places.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:55.250
This inning only: it’s for fine-tuning.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:02.790
A player can’t make it, at the last minute? Tap them: no need to start over, the bench fills the gaps.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:07.240
The changes are shown: copy them in pencil onto your sheet.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:12.650
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
